# 🛠 Hands-on Lab

## Lab 1 – Generate a SHA-256 Hash (Python)

```python
import hashlib

text = "Cybersecurity"

hash_value = hashlib.sha256(text.encode()).hexdigest()

print(hash_value)
```

Run it.

Now change one character.

Observe how completely the hash changes.

